## Scope-change triggers (`GATE-02`)

Stop and request renewed approval before:

- touching an unlisted file or module;
- changing a public API, schema, persistent data, or compatibility behavior;
- adding/updating a dependency or lockfile;
- changing build, CI, deployment, signing, secrets, or environment configuration;
- creating a new cross-module dependency or shared library;
- performing a destructive operation or external write;
- expanding the task to unrelated cleanup or refactoring.

